  "prefLabel": "Hcp 405.01 Fee Schedule for License and Registration Renewals",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hcp 405.01 Fee Schedule for License and Registration Renewals. The board’s fees for license and registration renewals shall be the fees set forth in Table 400-1.\n\nTable 400-1 Fees Charged by the Board of Hearing Care Providers for License and Registration Renewals\n\nType of Fee | Fee\n\nAudiologist license renewal | $300.00\n\nHearing aid dealer renewal | $300.00\n\nAudiologist license restoration | $350.00\n\nSource. #12112, eff 2-21-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/hcp100-500.html"
